    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-compression-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Interpret compressed purpose and conditions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A following 好 clause can state a purpose. Adjacent clauses may imply a condition; 不…也… can say that an outcome holds even without the named action.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你慢点儿说，好让我听懂。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ màn diǎnr shuō ， hǎo ràng wǒ tīngdǒng 。",
                "meaning": "Speak more slowly so that I can understand.",
                "audio": "9c2178756e0ea5fe9ff43bdca7b67e6591556b1ea239adf608be412a2b18086f"
              },
              {
                "text": "你来，我就去。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ lái ， wǒ jiù qù 。",
                "meaning": "If you come, I will go.",
                "audio": "19baf36d28a15d7ed6814537006fa2a1fef9267d2fa1ca73101af58a88b21f1f"
              },
              {
                "text": "不去也可以。",
                "pinyin": "bù qù yě kěyǐ 。",
                "meaning": "It is also all right not to go.",
                "audio": "69663d5db7aa33a70ea3ac323788360f4c9918eb278e87ac5c81ac2e842f1fb1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "好",
                "pinyin": "hǎo",
                "meaning": "so that; introduces the purpose of a preceding arrangement",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "c7be596b84c19af9adad9242f84af08b00fde86f52f7ecf64b4e7df54efa5886"
              },
              {
                "text": "不",
